  "question_count": 2,
  "is_atomic": false,
  "atomic_questions": [
    "What is the objective of this analysis — are we maximizing the total value of Carelland's exports (the goods it produces and sells on the world market)?",
    "Is the value measured at the given world-market prices with no other revenue or cost terms?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for the specific objective (maximizing export value) and separately asks for the definition of that value (world-market prices only). These are two distinct pieces of information that could be answered independently."
}

